  <p>This runs the real analysis: it tries hundreds of trial circles, computes both OMS and Bishop for each, and shows you the <strong>critical</strong> one &mdash; the circle with the lowest factor of safety. The r<sub>u</sub> slider is the pore-pressure ratio u/(&gamma;h); slide it up to simulate a slope saturating during a storm.</p>

  <div class="calc">
